<h2>Applying a Task Group to a Renewal</h2>

<p>
    There are a few ways to apply a task group:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>When creating a renewal</strong> – If you're creating a renewal from a policy, you can select a task group to apply during creation</li>
    <li><strong>From the renewal details page</strong> – Open an existing renewal and use the "Apply Task Group" option</li>
    <li><strong>Replacing existing tasks</strong> – You can apply a task group to a renewal that already has tasks (this will add the new tasks or replace them, depending on your settings)</li>
</ul>

<p>
    After applying a task group, you'll see all the tasks appear in the renewal's task board with their goal dates already calculated.
</p>

