<h2>Customizing Tasks After Applying</h2>

<p>
    Just because you applied a task group doesn't mean the tasks are set in stone. You can:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Adjust goal dates</strong> – If the standard timeline doesn't work for this particular renewal, change individual goal dates</li>
    <li><strong>Add additional tasks</strong> – Add one-off tasks that are specific to this renewal</li>
    <li><strong>Remove tasks</strong> – If a task doesn't apply to this renewal, you can remove it</li>
    <li><strong>Change assignments</strong> – Reassign tasks to different team members if needed</li>
    <li><strong>Add subtasks</strong> – Break down a task into smaller steps if needed</li>
</ul>

<p>
    The task group provides a starting point, but you have full flexibility to customize for each renewal.
</p>

