<h2>Organizing Task Groups by Line of Business</h2>

<p>
    Different types of policies often require different processes. Consider creating separate task groups for:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>General Liability</strong> – Tasks specific to GL renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Workers' Compensation</strong> – Tasks for WC renewals (might include payroll audits, class code reviews, etc.)</li>
    <li><strong>Commercial Auto</strong> – Tasks for auto policy renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Property</strong> – Tasks for property renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Package Policies</strong> – Tasks for policies that combine multiple coverages</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This way, when you create a renewal, you can apply the task group that matches the type of policy you're renewing.
</p>

