<h2>Common Task Group Examples</h2>

<p>
    Here are some common tasks you might include in a renewal task group:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Request Loss Runs</strong> (60-90 days before) – Get loss history from the current carrier</li>
    <li><strong>Gather Applications</strong> (45-60 days before) – Collect or update applications</li>
    <li><strong>Create Submissions</strong> (30-45 days before) – Submit to carriers for quotes</li>
    <li><strong>Review Quotes</strong> (15-30 days before) – Compare quotes and select the best option</li>
    <li><strong>Create Proposal</strong> (10-20 days before) – Prepare and send proposal to client</li>
    <li><strong>Follow Up with Client</strong> (5-10 days before) – Check on client's decision</li>
    <li><strong>Bind Coverage</strong> (On or before expiration) – Finalize the renewal</li>
    <li><strong>Renew in AMS</strong> (After binding) - Update your agency management system</li>
    <li><strong>Send Documents</strong> (After binding) – Provide policy documents to client</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Your specific tasks will depend on your agency's process, but this gives you an idea of a typical workflow.
</p>

